    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n35 Rosehill is a beautifully presented and meticulously maintained two-bedroom detached bungalow, ideally positioned within a quiet cul-de-sac in this highly sought-after development in the heart of Wicklow Town. Boasting breathtaking sea views and a sunny rear aspect, this charming home has been thoughtfully upgraded to create a stylish and comfortable living environment.\nExtending to approximately 66 sq.m., the bright and welcoming accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, spacious living room, contemporary kitchen, two well-proportioned double bedrooms, and a family bathroom. The interior has been recently renovated and finished in a tasteful neutral palette throughout, with notable upgrades including a stunning new kitchen, bespoke built-in media TV unit, and a feature wood-burning stove that creates a warm and inviting focal point within the living space.\nTo the rear, the property enjoys spectacular coastal views, while the garden has been carefully landscaped to maximise both space and outlook. A raised deck area directly off the kitchen provides the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing and taking in the scenery. Off-street parking is also available to the front of the property.\nRosehill is a mature and well-established residential development, popular with a wide range of buyers due to its convenient location within easy walking distance of local shops, schools, transport links, leisure facilities, and all the amenities Wicklow Town has to offer.\nCombining modern upgrades, stunning sea views, and an enviable town-centre location, 35 Rosehill presents a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey detached home in one of Wicklow Town's most desirable residential settings."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith custom built in storage.\n\nLiving/dining Room - \nA bright and spacious living room, beautifully presented and centred around a charming wood-burning stove, creating a warm and inviting focal point. A front-facing bay window fills the room with natural light and offers pleasant views to the front. The space is further enhanced by a bespoke built-in media TV unit, providing stylish storage and a contemporary finish, making it an ideal setting for both relaxation and entertaining.\n\nKitchen - \nThe newly installed shaker-style kitchen is beautifully finished with contemporary tiled flooring, an elegant tiled backsplash, and a range of newly fitted integrated appliances. Designed with both style and functionality in mind, it offers ample storage, generous countertop workspace, and additional preparation areas, making it ideal for modern family living. A door leads directly to the rear garden and raised deck, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor spaces, perfect for entertaining and al fresco dining.\n\nBedroom - \nA bright and well-proportioned double bedroom positioned to the rear of the property, enjoying stunning sea views. The room features hardwood flooring and offers a peaceful and relaxing retreat with an abundance of natural light.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nA bright double bedroom positioned to the side of the property, featuring new wood flooring and a tasteful décor. This comfortable room offers excellent accommodation with a warm and inviting atmosphere.\n\nBathroom - \nA well-appointed bathroom complete with a bath, electric Triton shower, wash hand basin and WC. Tastefully finished in a neutral colour palette, the room provides a bright and functional space for everyday living.\n\n"
      },
